# What the Vercel build never needs.
#
# The project's Root Directory is `WebSite`, but the CLI uploads from the
# repository root, and the siblings weigh 2.4 GB — `video/` (Remotion) and
# `Admin/` alone are 1.4 GB. A deploy from the root would spend minutes
# uploading files the build discards. Only `WebSite/` matters.
#
# Note: the presence of this file replaces .gitignore for upload filtering,
# so the usual ignores have to be repeated here.

video
Admin
server
_bmad
_bmad-output
sales

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.git
**/.env*.local
**/*.log
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
